OL,3,GNEWSAFireworks let off in street spark
OL,4,Ablaze at gym
OL,5,
OL,6,FA gym has been temporarily closed after
OL,7,Fa firework set off in the street came
OL,8,Fthrough a window and sparked a blaze
OL,9,Finside.
OL,11,FEmergency services were called to Gym
OL,12,FBeasts in Commercial Road in Bulwell,
OL,13,FNottingham, on Saturday night.
OL,15,FA video filmed from a nearby property
OL,16,Fat about 20:10 GMT shows a group of six
OL,17,Fpeople dressed in black letting off
OL,18,Ffireworks in the street.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
