OL,3,GNEWSAFireworks let off in street spark
OL,4,Ablaze at gym
OL,5,
OL,6,FGym owner Dean Smith said it was
OL,7,F"fortunate" no-one was in the building
OL,8,Fat the time, but added those setting
OL,9,Foff the fireworks were "putting
OL,10,Fthemselves in danger too".
